<Routines>
<Routine Name="Convert_WCT" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Converts 64 Bit Time Stamp to Gregorian.]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[SBR(Time_InRaw)NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[============================================================================================

CALCULATION TO CREATE A USABLE FORM OF WALL CLOCK TIME
These rungs fill a user defined structure with the current year, month, day, hour, minute, second, and microseconds

Note: Rungs 30,31,36,and 37 have been modified for the V16 year reference change from 1972 to 1970
============================================================================================

Move current wall clock time to WCT_RAW DINT array.  Wall clock time is a 64-bit value that represents the number of microseconds that have elapsed since 1/1/1970.

]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[COP(Time_InRaw[0],WCT_RAW[0],2) ,COP(WCT_RAW[0],WCT.Input_64Bit_Time[0],2) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Remove the AFI instruction to execute the rung logic]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[MOV(WCT_RAW[0],WCT_Convert_MicrosecondTemp[0]) ,AFI() BSR(WCT_Convert_MicrosecondTemp[0],WCT_Control_usBSR,WCT_Convert_BitIn,?) ,BSR(WCT_Convert_MicrosecondTemp[0],WCT_Control_usBSR,WCT_Convert_BitIn,?) ,MOD(WCT_Convert_MicrosecondTemp[0],500000,WCT_Convert_TempUSMod) ,MUL(WCT_Convert_TempUSMod,2,WCT.usec) ,XIC(WCT_RAW[0].0) ADD(WCT.usec,1,WCT.usec) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate the number of seconds that have elapsed since 1/1/1970.

Note 31st bit is interpreted seperatly as Logix interprets this bit as a sign bit and time is an unsigned value

]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[CPT(WCT_SCALED[0],(WCT_RAW[0] AND 16#7FFF_FFFF) / 1000000) ,XIC(WCT_RAW[0].31) MOV(2147.483648,WCT_SCALED[1]) ,XIO(WCT_RAW[0].31) MOV(0,WCT_SCALED[1]) ,CPT(WCT_SCALED[2],(WCT_RAW[1] * 4294)) CPT(WCT_SCALED[3],(WCT_RAW[1] * 0.967296)) ,CPT(WCT_eSeconds,WCT_SCALED[0] + WCT_SCALED[1] + WCT_SCALED[2] + WCT_SCALED[3]) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(WCT_DAYS_DINT,WCT_eSeconds / 86400);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[DIV(WCT_eSeconds,86400,WCT_DAYS_REAL);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[MUL(WCT_DAYS_REAL,86400,WCT_eSecondsTest);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[The following two rungs are used to calculate the fractional portion of the day present in the elapsed seconds value read from the controller WCT.  If the rounded DINT value is greater than the Floating point value calculated, then subtract one day from the DINT portion and then subtract that from the Floating point value.  If the Floating point value for the day is greater than the DINT value, use the DINT value to represent the elapsed days.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[GRT(WCT_DAYS_DINT,WCT_DAYS_REAL) ,EQU(WCT_DAYS_DINT,WCT_DAYS_REAL) GRT(WCT_eSecondsTest,WCT_eSeconds) ][SUB(WCT_DAYS_DINT,1,WCT.days) ,OTE(WCT_MoveBackOneDay) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(WCT_MoveBackOneDay)MOV(WCT_DAYS_DINT,WCT.days);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(WCT_RemainingSeconds,WCT_eSeconds - (WCT.days * 86400));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[DIV(WCT_RemainingSeconds,3600,WCT_Hours_REAL) ,DIV(WCT_RemainingSeconds,3600,WCT_Hours_DINT) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[GRT(WCT_Hours_DINT,WCT_Hours_REAL)SUB(WCT_Hours_DINT,1,WCT.hour);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LEQ(WCT_Hours_DINT,WCT_Hours_REAL)MOV(WCT_Hours_DINT,WCT.hour);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(WCT_Minutes_REAL,(WCT_RemainingSeconds - (WCT.hour * 3600)) / 60);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(WCT_Minutes_DINT,((WCT_RemainingSeconds - (WCT.hour * 3600)) / 60));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[GRT(WCT_Minutes_DINT,WCT_Minutes_REAL)SUB(WCT_Minutes_DINT,1,WCT.Minute);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LEQ(WCT_Minutes_DINT,WCT_Minutes_REAL)MOV(WCT_Minutes_DINT,WCT.Minute);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(WCT_Seconds_DINT,WCT_RemainingSeconds - (WCT.hour * 3600) - (WCT.Minute * 60));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="18" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Store DINT value of seconds in WCT structure.  (This value is rounded to nearest second.)
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOV(WCT_Seconds_DINT,WCT.second);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="19" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate offset from base date of 1/1/1970.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[DIV(WCT.days,365.2425,WCT_Year_Offset);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="20" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[ADD(WCT_Year_Offset,1970,WCT_Year_Real);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="21" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[ADD(WCT_Year_Offset,1970,WCT_Year_DINT);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="22" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[GRT(WCT_Year_DINT,WCT_Year_Real)SUB(WCT_Year_DINT,1,WCT.year);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="23" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LEQ(WCT_Year_DINT,WCT_Year_Real)MOV(WCT_Year_DINT,WCT.year);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="24" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[=================================
Determine if current year is a leap year.
=================================
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[DIV(WCT.year,4,WCT_LY4I) ,DIV(WCT.year,4,WCT_LY4R) ]EQU(WCT_LY4I,WCT_LY4R)OTE(WCT_LY4);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="25" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[DIV(WCT.year,100,WCT_LY100I) ,DIV(WCT.year,100,WCT_LY100R) ]EQU(WCT_LY100I,WCT_LY100R)OTE(WCT_LY100);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="26" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[DIV(WCT.year,400,WCT_LY400I) ,DIV(WCT.year,400,WCT_LY400R) ]EQU(WCT_LY400I,WCT_LY400R)OTE(WCT_LY400);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="27" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(WCT_LY4)[XIC(WCT_LY100) XIC(WCT_LY400) ,XIO(WCT_LY100) ]OTE(WCT_LeapYear);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="28" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(WCT_LeapYear)MOV(1,WCT_LYOffset);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="29" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(WCT_LeapYear)MOV(0,WCT_LYOffset);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="30" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If used in v8 - v15 change CPT Expression to (WCT.year - 1972) / 4
If used in v16 or greater change CPT Expression to ((WCT.year - 1970) / 4) -.5]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(WCT_4YearPeriodsDINT,((WCT.year - 1970) / 4)-.5);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="31" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If used in v8 - v15 change CPT Expression to (WCT.year - 1972) / 4
If used in v16 or greater change CPT Expression to ((WCT.year - 1970) / 4) -.5]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(WCT_4YearPeriodsREAL,((WCT.year - 1970) / 4)-.5);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="32" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[GRT(WCT_4YearPeriodsDINT,WCT_4YearPeriodsREAL)SUB(WCT_4YearPeriodsDINT,1,WCT_4YearPeriods);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="33" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LEQ(WCT_4YearPeriodsDINT,WCT_4YearPeriodsREAL)MOV(WCT_4YearPeriodsDINT,WCT_4YearPeriods);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="34" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(WCT_LeapYear)[CPT(WCT_1YearPeriodsDINT,(WCT.days - (WCT_4YearPeriods * 1461) - (1 - WCT_LYOffset)) / 365) ,CPT(WCT_1YearPeriodsREAL,(WCT.days - (WCT_4YearPeriods * 1461)-(1 - WCT_LYOffset)) / 365) ,GRT(WCT_1YearPeriodsDINT,WCT_1YearPeriodsREAL) SUB(WCT_1YearPeriodsDINT,1,WCT_1YearPeriods) ,LEQ(WCT_1YearPeriodsDINT,WCT_1YearPeriodsREAL) MOV(WCT_1YearPeriodsDINT,WCT_1YearPeriods) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="35" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(WCT_LeapYear)MOV(0,WCT_1YearPeriods);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="36" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If used in v8 - v15 change GRT Source B to 1972
If used in v16 or greater change GRT Source B to 1970]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[GRT(WCT.year,1970)CPT(WCT_ElapsedDays,WCT.days - (WCT_4YearPeriods * 1461) - (WCT_1YearPeriods * 365) - (1 - WCT_LYOffset));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="37" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If used in v8 - v15 change EQU Source B to 1972
If used in v16 or greater change EQU Source B to 1970]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(WCT.year,1970)MOV(WCT.days,WCT_ElapsedDays);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="38" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[==============================================
Determine month and day from elapsed days variable.
==============================================
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[LIM(0,WCT_ElapsedDays,30)[MOV(1,WCT.month) ,ADD(WCT_ElapsedDays,1,WCT.day) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="39" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(WCT_LeapYear)[LIM(31,WCT_ElapsedDays,58) [MOV(2,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,30,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(59,WCT_ElapsedDays,89) [MOV(3,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,58,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(90,WCT_ElapsedDays,119) [MOV(4,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,89,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(120,WCT_ElapsedDays,150) [MOV(5,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,119,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(151,WCT_ElapsedDays,180) [MOV(6,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,150,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(181,WCT_ElapsedDays,211) [MOV(7,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,180,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(212,WCT_ElapsedDays,242) [MOV(8,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,211,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(243,WCT_ElapsedDays,272) [MOV(9,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,242,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(273,WCT_ElapsedDays,303) [MOV(10,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,272,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(304,WCT_ElapsedDays,333) [MOV(11,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,303,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(334,WCT_ElapsedDays,366) [MOV(12,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,333,WCT.day) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="40" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(WCT_LeapYear)[LIM(31,WCT_ElapsedDays,59) [MOV(2,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,30,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(60,WCT_ElapsedDays,90) [MOV(3,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,59,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(91,WCT_ElapsedDays,120) [MOV(4,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,90,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(121,WCT_ElapsedDays,151) [MOV(5,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,120,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(152,WCT_ElapsedDays,181) [MOV(6,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,151,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(182,WCT_ElapsedDays,212) [MOV(7,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,181,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(213,WCT_ElapsedDays,243) [MOV(8,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,212,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(244,WCT_ElapsedDays,273) [MOV(9,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,243,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(274,WCT_ElapsedDays,304) [MOV(10,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,273,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(305,WCT_ElapsedDays,334) [MOV(11,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,304,WCT.day) ] ,LIM(335,WCT_ElapsedDays,366) [MOV(12,WCT.month) ,SUB(WCT_ElapsedDays,334,WCT.day) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="41" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[RET(WCT);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="MainRoutine" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[
All information provided  -- No warranty or implied merchantability.
Refer to the RSLogix 5000 End User License Agreement (EULA) in the Release Notes.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[GSV(WALLCLOCKTIME,,CurrentValue,Time_RAW[0]);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[===============================================================================
CALCULATE A USABLE FORM OF WALL CLOCK TIME
This routine fills a user defined structure with the current year, month, day, hour, minute, second, and microsecond
===============================================================================

Input 64 bit time stamp into Time_Raw
Output is Time_Interpreted which is a UDT of type datetime
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(Convert_WCT,1,Time_RAW,Time_Interpreted);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOV(Time_Interpreted.month,Month)MOV(Time_Interpreted.day,Day)MOV(Time_Interpreted.year,Year);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOV(Time_Interpreted.hour,Hour)MOV(Time_Interpreted.Minute,Minute)MOV(Time_Interpreted.second,Second)MOV(Time_Interpreted.usec,MicroSecond);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[
These next rungs are for testing purposes only and can be removed if desired.

]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[,LES(Second,0) ,GRT(Minute,59) ,LES(Minute,0) ,GRT(Hour,23) ,LES(Hour,0) ,GRT(Year,2038) ,LES(Year,1972) ,GRT(Month,12) ,LES(Month,1) ,[EQU(Month,1) ,EQU(Month,3) ,EQU(Month,5) ,EQU(Month,7) ,EQU(Month,8) ,EQU(Month,10) ,EQU(Month,12) ] GRT(Day,31) ,[EQU(Month,4) ,EQU(Month,6) ,EQU(Month,9) ,EQU(Month,11) ] GRT(Day,30) ,EQU(Month,2) [XIC(WCT_LeapYear) GRT(Day,29) ,XIO(WCT_LeapYear) GRT(Day,28) ] ,LES(Day,1) ]GRT(Second,59)OTL(WCT_Error);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
